/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot hH ω`. Conclude with `MAx3.dens_nil P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot ω`.
-/
theorem jacobi_base : Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.MA.EmptyWordEnergyDensity := by
