/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot hH`. Establish `hD` using `hH.2.1`. Use `show Integrable ((sysQ P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot).dens []) (mu0 P.r P.TT)`. Rewrite using `[show (sysQ P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot).dens [] = fun ω => ∑ π, ‖(j π : Qp P.r P.TT → ℂ) ω‖ ^ 2 from`. Use function extensionality and compare the values at `(MAx3.dens_nil P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot)]`.

Use `integrable_finset_sum _ fun π _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Use `hD [] (by simp) (by simp) π` as an intermediate fact. Rewrite `this` using `[List.prod_nil, MAx3.one_act]`. Conclude with `this`.
-/
theorem jacobi_square_integrable : Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.MA.SourceSquareIntegrable := by
  intro P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot hH
  have hD := hH.2.1
  show Integrable ((sysQ P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot).dens []) (mu0 P.r P.TT)
  rw [show (sysQ P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot).dens [] = fun ω => ∑ π, ‖(j π : Qp P.r P.TT → ℂ) ω‖ ^ 2 from
    funext (MAx3.dens_nil P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot)]
  refine integrable_finset_sum _ fun π _ => ?_
  have := hD [] (by simp) (by simp) π
  rw [List.prod_nil, MAx3.one_act] at this
  exact this

