/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot hH w hw hl Y hY`. Establish `hL` using `hH.1.2.2.2.1`. Take `⟨m, cc, h⟩` from `MAx3.jf_jet P (MAx2.Jet.gL_JF P l hL w Y (MAx3.mulF_JF P l L j w))`. Conclude with `⟨m, cc, fun φ hφ ω a => h φ hφ ω a⟩`.
-/
theorem jet_module_closed : Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.MA.JetQ := by
