/- English proof (translation)
Distinguish the cases in `h1 : e = e'`. Substitute `h1` using the available equality. Distinguish the cases in `h2 : π = π'`. Substitute `h2` using the available equality. Simplify using `[io, sc, Matrix.scalar_apply]`.

