/- English proof (translation)
Establish `hg : eulerQ (M.vcb l) (ggQ P.r P.TT) = 0` using `MAx1.euler_gamma_vanish hL _ (MAx1.vcb_vz l) (MAx1.vcb_vzb l)`. Establish `hc : (Finset.univ.filter fun m => M.vcb l = M.vc m ∨ M.vcb l = M.vcb m) = {l}`. Use extensionality with `m`. Simplify using `[MAx1.vcb_inj, (MAx1.vc_vcb _ _).symm, eq_comm]`. Rewrite using `[GQ_eq, euler_mul, ev_prod_gen hL (M.vcb l) (cc P) (fun m => M.vcb l = M.vc m ∨ M.vcb l = M.vcb m) (ev_cc hL _) Finset.univ, hg, hc, Finset.card_singleton]`.

