/- English proof (translation)
Establish `hc : (Finset.univ.filter fun m => v = M.vc m ∨ v = M.vcb m) = ∅`. Use extensionality with `m`. Apply the tactic sequence `rcases hv with rfl | rfl <;> simp [(MAx1.vc_vz m).symm, (MAx1.vcb_vz m).symm, (MAx1.vc_vzb m).symm, (MAx1.vcb_vzb m).symm]`. Establish `hg : eulerQ v (ggQ P.r P.TT) = coordQ M.vz * coordQ M.vzb`. Break down `hv with rfl | rfl` into its components or cases.

