/- English proof (translation)
Take `⟨_, h2, h3⟩` from `h`. Rewrite `h2`, `h3` using `[plusWord_cons]`. Use `⟨plusWord_slots_nodup w, fun a ha => ?_, ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Conclude with `h2 (liftL a) (List.mem_cons_of_mem _ (List.mem_map_of_mem ha))`. Use `(List.pairwise_cons.1 h3).2` as an intermediate fact.

Rewrite `this` using `[List.pairwise_map]`. Conclude with `this`.
