theorem sc_mul' (a b : (DQ P).Pr) : sc P (DQ P) a * sc P (DQ P) b = sc P (DQ P) (a * b) :=
  ((Matrix.scalar (M.Ty P)).map_mul a b).symm

/- English proof (translation)
The claim follows from `((Matrix.scalar (M.Ty P)).map_pow a n).symm`.
