theorem io_pow' {S : Type} [Fintype S] [DecidableEq S] (x : A P (DQ P)) (n : ℕ) :
    (io x : SlopeTestRemainingChoices S (A P (DQ P))) ^ n = io (x ^ n) :=
  ((Matrix.scalar (Ix S)).map_pow x n).symm

variable {P}

/- English proof (translation)
Take `⟨-, -, -, -, -, -, hz, -, hzb, -, -, hggi, -⟩` from `hL`. Unfold `wt`. Rewrite using `[hz, hzb, hggi]`. Use `show io (sc P (DQ P) _ * sc P (DQ P) _ * sc P (DQ P) _) = _`. Rewrite using `[sc_mul', sc_mul']`.

Both sides reduce to the same expression.
