/- English proof (translation)
Unfold `DnM d0`. Rewrite using `[Matrix.diagonal_mul, wt_sc hL, io_pow', ← sc_pow' P, io_diag, hc, Matrix.diagonal_mul_diagonal]`. Unfold `Dg`. Use `fin_cases b`. Simplify using `only [Fin.zero_eta, Fin.isValue, Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero, Matrix.empty_val', Matrix.cons_val_fin_one]`.

