Establish `h` using `mem_Icc.1 this.1`. Use `hle (j + 1) i (by omega) (by omega) h.2; linarith [(hab j hj).2]` as an intermediate fact. Establish `hP1 : 0 < ∏ m ∈ ((Icc 1 (k - 1)).erase j).filter (fun m => m < j), (b j - b m)` using `prod_pos fun m hm => by`. Establish `h` using `mem_filter.1 hm`. Establish `h2` using `mem_erase.1 h.1`.

Use `hbinc m h2.2 j hj h.2` as an intermediate fact. Combine the linear equalities and inequalities to obtain the conclusion. Establish `hP2 : 0 < ∏ m ∈ ((Icc 1 (k - 1)).erase j).filter (fun m => ¬ m < j), (b m - b j)` using `prod_pos fun m hm => by`. Establish `h` using `mem_filter.1 hm`. Establish `h2` using `mem_erase.1 h.1`.

