The claim follows from `| [], _, e => by simp [cs, csR] | b :: v, h, e => by have hb := h b List.mem_cons_self have hv : ∀ a ∈ v, a.plus = true ∧ a.pt.im = 0 := fun a ha => h a (List.mem_cons_of_mem _ ha) have ih := cs_real x0 q0 x0R q0R hx hq v hv e have hp := pt_eq hb.2 simp only [cs, csR, hb.1, if_tr …`.
