/- English proof (translation)
Establish `hne1 : Y - p ≠ 0` using `by intro e; linarith`. Establish `hne2 : Y + s - p ≠ 0` using `by intro e; linarith`. Establish `e : ((Y : ℂ) - (p : ℂ))⁻¹ - (((Y + s : ℝ) : ℂ) - (p : ℂ))⁻¹ = ((s / ((Y - p) * (Y + s - p)) : ℝ) : ℂ)`. Establish `hc1 : (Y : ℂ) - p ≠ 0` using `by exact_mod_cast hne1`. Establish `hc2 : (Y : ℂ) + s - p ≠ 0` using `by exact_mod_cast hne2`.

