theorem memF {x : A} (hx : x ∈ L.fns) : x ∈ Subring.closure (FS L) := Subring.subset_closure (Or.inl hx)
/- English proof (translation)
The claim follows from `Subring.subset_closure (Or.inr ⟨a, rfl⟩)`.
