/- English proof (translation)
The claim follows from `Algebra.subset_adjoin hx`.
-/
theorem gen_BA {x : A P (DQ P)} (hx : x ∈ bddSet P L) : x ∈ BA L := Algebra.subset_adjoin hx

/- English proof (translation)
The claim follows from `gen_BA hL hLaw (Or.inl (Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨f, rfl⟩)))`.
