/- English proof (translation)
The claim follows from `Subalgebra.sum_mem _ fun i _ => Subalgebra.sum_mem _ fun j _ => mul_mem (eU_B hL hLaw a i j) (MAx2.Jet.matrix_two_mem_sub (UB L S) x y z w hx hy hz hw i j)`.
