The claim follows from `| [] => ⟨fun Y => io_B hL hLaw (eeA_BA hL hLaw Y), fun Y => io_B hL hLaw (kap_BA hL hLaw _), fun Y => io_B hL hLaw (kap_BA hL hLaw _)⟩ | lt :: w => by obtain ⟨he, hx, hxi⟩ := frame_memB l w have htz : (tz L : SlopeTestRemainingChoices S (A P (DQ P))) ∈ UB L S := io_B hL hLaw (Sub …`.
