Take `⟨𝒳, h1, h2⟩` from `Xw_rep hL hLaw l j w`. Establish `hE : (frW P l L w).ee (Y : ℂ) ∈ UB L (Fin w.length)` using `(frame_memB hL hLaw l (wordP w)).1 (Y : ℂ)`. Use `⟨lvec L ((Y : ℂ) + s) ((Y : ℂ) + s) ((frW P l L w).ee (Y : ℂ)) 𝒳, lvec_NF hL hLaw _ _ _ hE 𝒳 h1, fun q bi => ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Take `⟨b, i⟩` from `bi`. Rewrite using `[G.conjS_gL P hTT hL w Y s _ (G.Xw_mem P l L j w) q b i]`.

