Unfold `tm`. Rewrite using `[MAx2.R2.act_mul, MAx2.R2.act_mul, hactb]`. Simplify using `only [hD]`. Rewrite using `[e, List.map_map, ← h1]`. Establish `hsum : (List.map ((fun t => ‖evQ P (actA P t.1.prod j t.2) q‖) ∘ fun π' => (H, π')) (Finset.univ : Finset (M.Ty P)).toList).sum = ∑ π', ‖evQ P (actA P H.prod j π') q‖`.

Rewrite using `[Finset.sum_map_toList]`. Both sides reduce to the same expression. Rewrite using `[hsum, Finset.mul_sum]`. Combine the equalities or inequalities in the displayed calculation. Rewrite using `[Finset.sum_mul]`.

