Rewrite using `[MAx2.R2.act_add, G.evQ_add, List.map_append, List.sum_append]`. Establish `s1` using `sumT_nonneg j T1 q`. Establish `s2` using `sumT_nonneg j T2 q`. Establish `hDp` using `pow_nonneg (Dabs_pos hTTp.le q).le d`. Combine the equalities or inequalities in the displayed calculation.

