theorem th_le (ε σ x : ℝ) (n : ℕ) (hε : 0 < ε) (hx : 0 < x) (hσ : (n : ℝ) ≤ σ) :
    LE.th ε σ x ≤ (ε⁻¹) ^ n * x ^ n := by
  unfold LE.th
  have hb0 : 0 < x / (x + ε) := div_pos hx (by linarith)
  have hb1 : x / (x + ε) ≤ 1 := (div_le_one (by linarith)).2 (by linarith)
  calc (x / (x + ε)) ^ σ ≤ (x / (x + ε)) ^ (n : ℝ) := Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_exponent_ge hb0 hb1 hσ
    _ = x ^ n / (x + ε) ^ n := by rw [Real.rpow_natCast, div_pow]
    _ ≤ x ^ n / ε ^ n := div_le_div_of_nonneg_left (pow_nonneg hx.le n) (pow_pos hε n)
          (pow_le_pow_left₀ hε.le (by linarith) n)
    _ = (ε⁻¹) ^ n * x ^ n := by rw [inv_pow, div_eq_inv_mul]

/- English proof (translation)
Establish `hG` using `Gq_pos P q`. Establish `hth0 : 0 ≤ LE.th ε σ (Gq P q)` using `by unfold LE.th; positivity`. Establish `hW : Wq P q ^ n * Gq P q ^ n = Dabs q ^ (2 * n)` using `by rw [pow_mul, Dabs_sq hTT, mul_pow, mul_comm]`. Establish `hth` using `th_le ε σ (Gq P q) n hε hG hσ`. Establish `hWn : 0 ≤ Wq P q ^ n` using `pow_nonneg (MAx3.Wq_pos P hTT q).le n`.

Establish `hc : 0 ≤ |c|` using `abs_nonneg c`. Combine the equalities or inequalities in the displayed calculation. Apply `mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right _ (sq_nonneg _)` to reduce the goal to its premises. Apply `mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left _ hth0` to reduce the goal to its premises. Conclude with `mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (le_abs_self c) hWn`.

