Take `⟨ts, h, e⟩` from `hE`. Use `⟨ts.map fun t => (t.1, t.2 * X), fun t ht => ?_, fun Y => ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Take `⟨t, ht', rfl⟩` from `List.mem_map.1 ht`. Conclude with `⟨mul_mem (h t ht').1 hX, (h t ht').2⟩`. Simplify using `only`.

