  have := rep_smul (fun _ => (-1 : ℂ)) (fun _ _ => continuousAt_const) hE
  simpa using this

/- English proof (translation)
Unfold `ins`. Establish `h2 : ∀ i : Fin 2, Rep L G (fun Y => ∑ j, eU a i j * E Y i j)` using `fun i => by`. Establish `e : (fun Y => ∑ j, eU a i j * E Y i j) = fun Y => eU a i 0 * E Y i 0 + eU a i 1 * E Y i 1`. Use function extensionality and compare the values at `fun Y => Fin.sum_univ_two (fun j => eU a i j * E Y i j)`. Rewrite using `[e]`.

