/- English proof (translation)
Establish `e : (fun Y => dwW P l (Y :: w) q (b, i)) = fun Y => Wq P q ^ (w.length + 1) * kap' P l w b i Y`. Use function extensionality and compare the values at `fun Y => dw_eq w Y q b i`. Rewrite using `[e]`. Conclude with `continuousOn_const.mul (hkc (b, i))`.
