/- English proof (translation)
Establish `key : ∀ a : Bool × Iota P w.length, ContinuousOn (fun Y : ℝ => dwW P l (Y :: w) q a * ‖gL P l L w Y X q a‖ ^ 2) K`. Introduce `a`. Break down `a with ⟨b, i⟩` into its components or cases. Establish `hg : ContinuousOn (fun Y : ℝ => gL P l L w Y X q (b, i)) K`. Consider the cases of `b`.

