  rw [MAx2.Jet.evQ_mul, MAx2.Jet.ev_Phi P (smoothLog_chi c ε)]

/- English proof (translation)
Take `⟨K, cc, hcc, hexp⟩` from `chi_expand hTTp hL hLaw j c ε hx`. Establish `hB : ∀ p, I4.NFB L j N N (cc p)` using `fun p => I4.normal_form_two_bounded hTTp hL hLaw j (hcc p)`. Use `choose Cp Tp hCp hTp hbp using hB`. Establish `hχ : ∀ p : ℕ, ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ ε x : ℝ, 0 < ε → 0 < x → |LE.ld p (c.sc ε 1) x| ≤ C ∧ (x < ε / 2 → LE.ld p (c.sc ε 1) x = 0) ∧ (ε < x → LE.ld p (c.sc ε 1) x = if p = 0 then 1 else 0)` using `fun p => Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.P.cutoff_bound c 1 p le_rfl`. Use `choose Cχ hCχ using hχ`.

