Rewrite using `[h0, norm_zero]`. Simplify using `only [ne_eq, OfNat.ofNat_ne_zero, not_false_eq_true, zero_pow, mul_zero]`. Conclude with `mul_nonneg hC hS`. Use `push Not at hq set X := evQ P (actA P x (chiJ P j c ε) π) q set S1 : ℕ → ℝ := fun p => ((Tp p).map fun t => ‖evQ P (actA P t.1.prod j t.2) q‖).sum set S2 : ℕ → ℝ := fun p => ((Tp p).map fun t => ‖evQ P (actA P t.1.prod j t.2) q‖ ^ 2).sum`. Establish `hDq` using `I4.Dabs_pos hTTp.le q`.

