Rewrite using `[← this, hcomp]`. Establish `hint : ∀ e π, Integrable (fun q => Wq P q ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ P (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε) π) q‖ ^ 2) (mu0 P.r P.TT)`. Introduce `e π`. Establish `h` using `term_integrable hTTp hML hLaw j c ε hε hD (N := (List.ofFn Y).length) (by omega) (h𝒳 e) (cs0 e π).re π`. Establish `e2 : ∀ q, Wq P q ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ P (actA P (𝒳 e) (chiJ P j c ε) π) q‖ ^ 2 = Wq P q ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ P (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε) π) q‖ ^ 2` using `fun q => by rw [hcomp' e π q]`.

Conclude with `h.congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall e2)`. Establish `hLHS : formDF P l L' j c Y ε = ∑ e, ∑ π, ∫ q, Wq P q ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ P (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε) π) q‖ ^ 2 ∂mu0 P.r P.TT`. Unfold `formDF`. Establish `hd : dRing P l L' Y = (wt L' : SlopeTestRemainingChoices (Fin (List.ofFn Y).length) (A P (DQ P))) ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * Matrix.diagonal (fun e => kap P (DQ P) (cs0 e))`. Unfold `dRing frW`.

Rewrite using `[hFCw.2.2.1]`. Rewrite using `[hd, Complex.re_sum]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun e _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Unfold `ipA`. Rewrite using `[Complex.re_sum]`.

Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun π _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Rewrite using `[lhs_term hTTp hML hLaw cs0 hcs (gRing P l L' Y) (chiJ P j c ε) e π, Complex.ofReal_re]`. Establish `hRHS : ∀ ω : Qp P.r P.TT, LE.sq (baseQ P) (((sysQ P l L' j lam α β Lb c Ntot).fam N).dw Y) (((sysQ P l L' j lam α β Lb c Ntot).fam N).gw Y (LE.mulF (baseQ P) (c.sc ε 1) ((sysQ P l L' j lam α β Lb c Ntot).fam N).u)) ω = ∑ e, ∑ π, Wq P ω ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ …`. Introduce `ω`. Unfold `LE.sq`.

Use `show ∑ i : Iota P N, (Wq P ω ^ N * (cs (M.x0 P l (ixOf P _ (cast (iota_len P N Y) i)).2) (M.qC P) (wordP (List.ofFn Y)) (ixOf P _ (cast (iota_len P N Y) i)).1).re) * ‖Xw P l L' (LE.mulF (baseQ P) (c.sc ε 1) (ju P j)) (List.ofFn Y) ω (cast (iota_len P N Y) i)‖ ^ 2 = _`. Rewrite using `[← ju_chiJ, sum_cast Y (fun i' => (Wq P ω ^ N * (cs (M.x0 P l (ixOf P _ i').2) (M.qC P) (wordP (List.ofFn Y)) (ixOf P _ i').1).re) * ‖Xw P l L' (ju P (chiJ P j c ε)) (List.ofFn Y) ω i'‖ ^ 2)]`. Rewrite using `[← sum_iota_real (P := P) (fun e π => Wq P ω ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * (cs0 e π).re * ‖evQ P (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε) π) ω‖ ^ 2)]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Establish `hW : Wq P ω ^ N = Wq P ω ^ (List.ofFn Y).length` using `by rw [hlen]`.

