/- English proof (translation)
Use `Prod.ext ?_ (MulOpposite.unop_injective ?_)` and prove the remaining obligations. Apply `LinearMap.ext` to reduce the goal to its premises. Introduce `f`. Use `(fst_leib P x c d σ hx1 hconj φ hφ (asS P f)).trans ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Rewrite using `[G.pfst_sum, LinearMap.sum_apply]`.

