theorem CF_act {s : A P (DQ P)} {g : Qp P.r P.TT → ℂ} (hs : CF s g) (f : M.Ty P → SmQ P.r P.TT) (q : Qp P.r P.TT)
    (π : M.Ty P) : evQ P (actA P s f π) q = g q * evQ P (f π) q ∧
      evQ P (actA P (star s) f π) q = conj (g q) * evQ P (f π) q := by
  obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := SA_of_CF hs
  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [h1, Finset.sum_eq_single π (fun b _ hb => by dsimp only; rw [Matrix.diagonal_apply_ne _ (Ne.symm hb), zero_mul])
      (by simp)]
    simp
  · rw [h2, Finset.sum_eq_single π (fun b _ hb => by dsimp only; rw [Matrix.diagonal_apply_ne _ hb, map_zero, zero_mul])
      (by simp)]
    simp

/- English proof (translation)
Take `⟨F, Fb, rfl, h1, h2⟩` from `hs`. Conclude with `⟨Fb, F, by rw [MAx2.R2.star_sc]; rfl, h2, fun q => by rw [Complex.conj_conj, h1]⟩`.
-/
theorem star_CF {s : A P (DQ P)} {g : Qp P.r P.TT → ℂ} (hs : CF s g) : CF (star s) (fun q => conj (g q)) := by
  obtain ⟨F, Fb, rfl, h1, h2⟩ := hs
  exact ⟨Fb, F, by rw [MAx2.R2.star_sc]; rfl, h2, fun q => by rw [Complex.conj_conj, h1]⟩

variable {L : LevelData (A P (DQ P)) P.r} (hL : IsModelLevel P (DQ P) L) (hLaw : (DQ P).Laws P.TT)
include hL hLaw

/- English proof (translation)
Establish `fc : ∀ G' Gb : (DQ P).R, (DQ P).fnP G' Gb * (DQ P).fnP F Fb = (DQ P).fnP F Fb * (DQ P).fnP G' Gb` using `fun G' Gb => Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.P.MAx1.multiplierPair_comm (DQ P) _ _ _ _`. Establish `scm : ∀ G' Gb : (DQ P).R, sc P (DQ P) ((DQ P).fnP G' Gb) ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `fun G' Gb => sc_mem_EC (fc G' Gb).symm`. Take `⟨hp, hpb, hc, hci, hcb, hcbi, hz, hzi, hzb, hzbi, -⟩` from `hL`. Establish `lp : ∀ {n : ℕ} (x : Fin n → A P (DQ P)), (∀ i, x i ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)) → (List.ofFn x).prod ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `fun x h => Submonoid.list_prod_mem _ fun y hy => by obtain ⟨i, rfl⟩ := List.mem_ofFn.1 hy; exact h i`. Establish `mDr` using `lp L.c fun l => by rw [hc]; exact scm _ _`.

Establish `mDri` using `lp L.ci fun l => by rw [hci]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mDrb` using `lp L.cb fun l => by rw [hcb]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mDrbi` using `lp L.cbi fun l => by rw [hcbi]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mz : L.ζ ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `by rw [hz]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mzi : L.ζi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `by rw [hzi]; exact scm _ _`.

Establish `mzb : L.ζb ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `by rw [hzb]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mzbi : L.ζbi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `by rw [hzbi]; exact scm _ _`. Establish `mSS : ∀ i, SS P (DQ P) i ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)` using `fun i => by classical`. Apply the tactic sequence `exact alg_mem_EC _ _ (fun π' π => if M.Up P i π π' then ((Real.sqrt (M.Nrm P i π) : ℝ) : ℂ) else 0) (fun π' π => by simp only [SS, Matrix.of_apply]; split_ifs <;> simp)`. Use `⟨mzi, mzbi, Submonoid.mul_mem _ (Submonoid.mul_mem _ mDr mz) (Submonoid.mul_mem _ mzbi mDrbi), Submonoid.mul_mem _ (Submonoid.mul_mem _ mDrb mzb) (Submonoid.mul_mem _ mzi mDri), fun f => ?_, fun i => Submonoid.mul_mem _ (Submonoid.mul_mem _ mDrb mDri) (mSS i)⟩` and prove the remaining obligations.

Conclude with `alg_mem_EC _ _ (fun π π' => if π = π' then f π else 0) fun π π' => by`. Establish `e : kap P (DQ P) f = Matrix.diagonal fun π => algebraMap ℂ (DQ P).Pr (f π)` using `rfl`. Apply the tactic sequence `rw [e, Matrix.diagonal_apply]; split_ifs <;> simp`.
-/
theorem gens_EC (F Fb : (DQ P).R) : L.ζi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) ∧ L.ζbi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) ∧
    L.D * L.Dbi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) ∧ L.Db * L.Di ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) ∧
    (∀ f, kap P (DQ P) f ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)) ∧ ∀ i, L.Drb * L.Dri * SS P (DQ P) i ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := by
  have fc : ∀ G' Gb : (DQ P).R, (DQ P).fnP G' Gb * (DQ P).fnP F Fb = (DQ P).fnP F Fb * (DQ P).fnP G' Gb :=
    fun G' Gb => Formalism.FourierDecayAlt.P.MAx1.multiplierPair_comm (DQ P) _ _ _ _
  have scm : ∀ G' Gb : (DQ P).R, sc P (DQ P) ((DQ P).fnP G' Gb) ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := fun G' Gb =>
    sc_mem_EC (fc G' Gb).symm
  obtain ⟨hp, hpb, hc, hci, hcb, hcbi, hz, hzi, hzb, hzbi, -⟩ := hL
  have lp : ∀ {n : ℕ} (x : Fin n → A P (DQ P)), (∀ i, x i ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb)) →
      (List.ofFn x).prod ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) :=
    fun x h => Submonoid.list_prod_mem _ fun y hy => by obtain ⟨i, rfl⟩ := List.mem_ofFn.1 hy; exact h i
  have mDr := lp L.c fun l => by rw [hc]; exact scm _ _
  have mDri := lp L.ci fun l => by rw [hci]; exact scm _ _
  have mDrb := lp L.cb fun l => by rw [hcb]; exact scm _ _
  have mDrbi := lp L.cbi fun l => by rw [hcbi]; exact scm _ _
  have mz : L.ζ ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := by rw [hz]; exact scm _ _
  have mzi : L.ζi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := by rw [hzi]; exact scm _ _
  have mzb : L.ζb ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := by rw [hzb]; exact scm _ _
  have mzbi : L.ζbi ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := by rw [hzbi]; exact scm _ _
  have mSS : ∀ i, SS P (DQ P) i ∈ EC ((DQ P).fnP F Fb) := fun i => by
    classical
    exact alg_mem_EC _ _ (fun π' π => if M.Up P i π π' then ((Real.sqrt (M.Nrm P i π) : ℝ) : ℂ) else 0)
