/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `P l L j lam α β Lb c Ntot hH N Y hN hB ε hε`. Establish `hz` using `T_memZ hH Y hN hB hε`. Take `⟨⟨hOK, hl1, hlk, hML, hu, hu', hαβ, hcut⟩, hD, hA, hE, hN1, -⟩` from `id hH`. Establish `hTTp : 0 < P.TT` using `mul_pos hOK.T_pos hOK.T'_pos`. Establish `hLaw` using `analytic_laws P.r P.TT hTTp.le`.

Establish `hcw : M.CutWord P l (wordP (List.ofFn Y))` using `MAx3.F.cutWord_of hH c (List.ofFn Y) hB (by simpa using hN)`. Take `⟨L', hL', -, -, hFC⟩` from `model_frame_analytic P hOK l hl1 hlk`. Establish `hLL` using `MAx3.F.level_unique P (DQ P) L' L hL' hML`. Substitute `hLL` using the available equality. Establish `hFCw` using `hFC (Fin (List.ofFn Y).length) (wordP (List.ofFn Y)) hcw`.

Establish `hS` using `sites_admissible P (DQ P) hLaw l`. Establish `hFr : ∀ w' : List ℝ, M.CutWord P l (wordP w') → IsFrame L' (ofWord L' (startM P (DQ P) l) (wordP w'))` using `fun w' h => (hFC _ _ h).1`. Use `set cs0 : Ix (Fin (List.ofFn Y).length) → M.Ty P → ℂ := fun e π => cs (M.x0 P l π) (M.qC P) (wordP (List.ofFn Y)) e with hcs0`. Establish `hd : dRing P l L' Y = (wt L' : SlopeTestRemainingChoices (Fin (List.ofFn Y).length) (A P (DQ P))) ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * Matrix.diagonal (fun e => kap P (DQ P) (cs0 e))`. Unfold `dRing frW`.

