Take `⟨SeriesExist, hSB1⟩ : ∃ C, SAB (1 : A P (DQ P)) C` from `⟨1, SAB_one⟩`. Take `⟨-, -, e1⟩` from `multAdj hTTp hML hLaw hD hSB1 hs (W := []) (by simp) (by simp) (k := (List.ofFn Y).length + (List.ofFn Y).length) hm hsa`. Simplify using `only [List.prod_nil, mul_one, one_mul, star_one, MAx2.R2.act_one] at e1`. Rewrite using `[e1, star_Ph, ← mul_assoc]`. Establish `hR1 : ∑ e, ipA P (actA P (∑ e', dRing P l L' Y e e' * gRing P l L' Y e') (chiJ P j c ε)) (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε)) = ipA P (actA P (Ph P (MAx3.PG.chi c ε) * (∑ e, ∑ e', star (gRing P l L' Y e) * dRing P l L' Y e e' * gRing P l L' Y e') * Ph P (MAx3.PG.chi c ε)) j …`.

Establish `hq : ∀ e, QA L' j ((L'.ζ * L'.ζb * L'.GGi) ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * kap P (DQ P) (cs0 e) * gRing P l L' Y e * Ph P (MAx3.PG.chi c ε)) (gRing P l L' Y e * Ph P (MAx3.PG.chi c ε))` using `fun e => QA_NF hTTp hML hLaw hD hA hm (hsa_U hTTp hML hLaw (cs0 e) hχ (hg e)) hχ (hg e)`. Establish `step : ∀ e, ipA P (actA P (∑ e', dRing P l L' Y e e' * gRing P l L' Y e') (chiJ P j c ε)) (actA P (gRing P l L' Y e) (chiJ P j c ε)) = ipA P (actA P (star (gRing P l L' Y e * Ph P (MAx3.PG.chi c ε)) * ((L'.ζ * L'.ζb * L'.GGi) ^ (List.ofFn Y).length * kap P (DQ P) (cs0 e) * gRing …`. Introduce `e`. Rewrite using `[chiJ_Ph, mul_one, ← MAx3.F.actA_mul, ← MAx3.F.actA_mul, hU e]`. Conclude with `(hq e).2.2`.

